@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+Feature: Edit Enter key conformance
+  As the project
+  I want the edit-field Enter handler to release focus rather than commit directly
+  So that a single blur handler performs the one and only commit
+
+  @conformance
+  Scenario: Enter keydown handler calls blur and does not call saveEdit directly
+    Given the production source at "js/app.js"
+    When the Enter keydown handler for the edit field is inspected
+    Then the handler calls ".blur()" on the edit input
+    And the handler does not call "saveEdit" directly
diff --git a/features/step_definitions/steps.js b/features/step_definitions/steps.js
